#-----------------------------------------------------------
# PUBLISH - BACKUP
#-----------------------------------------------------------

Text1 publish/backupcdheader
Create a Backup CD

Text2 publish/backupcdheader
Create a Set or use an existing one

Label publish/backupcdheader2
Choose folders & albums to back up

Text1 publish/backuptext
A Backup Set records where to store backed-up files, and it also keeps a record of which files have been backed up already, so you don't have to back them up again.

Label publish/backuptext2
Picasa is now showing the files you have not previously backed up.

Label publish/backuptext3
Check the folders you want to back up, or choose 'Select All' to choose everything.

Label publish/backup_go
Burn Disc

Label publish/backup_help
Help

Label publish/backup_eject
Eject

Label publish/backup_cancel
Cancel

Label publish/newbackupset
New Set

Label publish/deletebackupset
Delete Set

Label publish/editbackupset
Edit Set

Text publish/label_backupname
Backup Set

Label publish/selectall
Select All

Label publish/selectnone
Select None

#-----------------------------------------------------------
# PUBLISH - REPLICATE
#-----------------------------------------------------------

Label publish/label_rpoptionbox1
Upload

Tooltip publish/rpoptionbox1
Selected folder and/or albums will be uploaded

Label publish/label_rpoptionbox2
Change options

Tooltip publish/rpoptionbox2
Selected folders and/or albums will be updated online with the options specified in the menus to the right

Label publish/label_rpoptionbox3
Remove online

Tooltip1 publish/rpoptionbox3
Selected folders and/or albums will be removed from Picasa Web Albums

Tooltip2 publish/rpoptionbox3
Selected folders and/or albums will be removed from Google Photos

Label publish/replicate_go
OK

Tooltip publish/replicate_go
Your chosen action will commence

Label publish/replicate_cancel
Cancel

Tooltip publish/replicate_cancel
Return to Library without making any changes online

Label publish/upgradestorage
Upgrade storage

Tooltip publish/upgradestorage
Additional storage can allow you to upload more photos

Text publish/uploadallactionstitle
Choose action for selected folders and albums:

Text1 publish/uploadallinfotext
Picasa is now showing only folders and albums containing photos you have not previously uploaded.

Text2 publish/uploadallinfotext
Picasa is now showing only folders and albums containing photos already online which do not match the options you have selected.

Text3 publish/uploadallinfotext
Picasa is now showing only folders and albums containing photos already online.

Text publish/uploadallstoragetitle
Storage:

Text publish/used_storage
Currently used storage

Text publish/full_storage
After this upload, you will be using all your storage.

Text publish/needed_storage
You need more storage to upload all that!

Text publish/final_storage
Your storage after this upload

Text publish/uploadalloptionstitle
Upload Options:

Text publish/uploadsize3
Size:

Tooltip1 publish/uploadallsize
The size of the photo when uploaded to Picasa Web Albums

Tooltip2 publish/uploadallsize
The size of the photo when uploaded to Google Photos

Text publish/uploadaccess3
Visibility:

Tooltip1 publish/uploadallaccess
Set the access of the album for Picasa Web Albums

Tooltip2 publish/uploadallaccess
Set the access of the album for Google Photos

Text publish/uploadsync3
Sync:

Tooltip publish/uploadallsync
Change the sync setting for the selected folders and/or albums
